{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12348","headline":"奉和宣城张太守南亭秋夕怀友 · 钱起","name":"奉和宣城张太守南亭秋夕怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池馆蟪蛄声，梧桐秋露晴。\n月临朱戟静，河近画楼明。\n卷幔浮凉入，闻钟永夜清。\n片云悬曙斗，数雁过秋城。\n羽扇扬风暇，瑶琴怅别情。\n江山飞丽藻，谢朓让前名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}